@startuml IAMS_VisitScheduling_State_PrePost_Clear
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state { FontSize 10 }
skinparam note { FontSize 8 }

title Site Visit Scheduling — Preconditions & Postconditions\n(Supervisor: Save & notify students)

legend left
  |= Color |= Meaning |
  | <#FFFDE7> PRE | Must be true before step |
  | <#ECFDF5> POST | True after step |
  | Green arrow | Success path |
  | Red arrow | Error path |
endlegend

[*] --> PreconditionsValidated

note left of PreconditionsValidated #FFFDE7
  **PRE (initial)**
  • Supervisor logged in
  • lecturer_id in session
  • dates[] in POST
end note

PreconditionsValidated : **POST:** inputs accepted

PreconditionsValidated --> CheckingDates : saveAndNotifyStudents()

state "① Date Validation" as DV {
  CheckingDates
  DateAvailable
  DateUnavailable

  CheckingDates --> DateAvailable : normalizeDates()\n[≥1 valid date]
  CheckingDates --> DateUnavailable : normalizeDates()\n[empty / invalid]
}

note bottom of DateAvailable #ECFDF5
  **POST:** YYYY-MM-DD keys
end note

note right of DateUnavailable #FEE2E2
  **POST:** error flag set
end note

DateAvailable --> SyncingAvailability : proceedWithPublish()\n**PRE:** ≥1 valid date

state "② Schedule Creation" as SC {
  SyncingAvailability
  DatesPersisted
  PublishedFlagSet

  SyncingAvailability --> DatesPersisted : syncAvailability()
  DatesPersisted --> PublishedFlagSet : setPublishedAt()
}

note right of PublishedFlagSet #ECFDF5
  **POST:** DB synced\npublished_at = NOW
end note

PublishedFlagSet --> NotifyingStudents : initiateNotifications()\n**PRE:** published_at set

state "③ Notification Processing" as NP {
  NotifyingStudents
  AlertsStored
  NotificationsComplete

  NotifyingStudents --> AlertsStored : createInSystemAlerts()
  AlertsStored --> NotificationsComplete : notifyComplete()
}

note right of NotificationsComplete #ECFDF5
  **POST:** student_notifications\n(in-system only, no email)
end note

NotificationsComplete --> OperationSuccess : completeOperation()

note bottom of OperationSuccess #ECFDF5
  **POST (final success)**
  • Dates in supervisor_visit_availability
  • Students alerted
  • UI success message
end note

OperationSuccess --> [*]

DateUnavailable --> OperationError : handleDateError() #line:red;line.bold;text:red

note right of OperationError #FEE2E2
  **POST (final error)**
  • No publish
  • No notifications
  • UI error message
end note

OperationError --> [*]

@enduml
